  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Organisational Systems Development and Strengthening</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project rationale primarily hinges upon facilitating and supporting the Bishops to have a functional national Caritas in place with a conducive working environment supported by solid operational systems and a skilled workforce to provide quality programming and service delivery to the less privileged populations nationwide. The activity is an extract from the partner&apos;s main proposal for organisational systems development and review, which is still under review. The selected activity proposed for funding is critical in setting up the partner&apos;s capacity framework.</narrative>
  </description>
